+++ b/openspec/changes/archive/2026-11-11-add-cancellation/design.md
@@ -0,0 +1,19 @@
+## Context
+
+`createRentalService` keeps bookings in an array; `isFree` checks overlap against all of them. Booking ids are `booking-N`.
+
+## Goals / Non-Goals
+
+**Goals:** add `cancel`, free the equipment, refund per the existing policy.
+**Non-Goals:** partial refunds, fees, rescheduling, season enforcement.
+
+## Decisions
+
+- Cancelled bookings are removed from the `bookings` array, and their ids are kept in a `Set` of cancelled ids. `isFree` is then unchanged, and a repeated cancel is told apart from an unknown id (both throw).
+- `at` is parsed with `Date.parse` after a strict ISO-8601 UTC regex (any time of day, unlike `parseOnTheHour`); anything else throws.
+- Refund: `startMs - atMs >= 24h` gives the booking total, otherwise 0.
+- TypeScript strict, Node standard library only, no runtime dependency.
+
+## Risks / Trade-offs
+
+- Cancelled bookings are not retained for history; acceptable since the service has no listing operation.
